# Charged ollie, pop shove-it (J + down) right after the pop: the board turns half a turn and lands.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+down 96
run 300
expect event trickEnd{trick=Pop Shove-It} within 120..160
expect event comboLanded{name=Pop Shove-It,points=100} within 160..240
expect no event bail
